    "Procurement is where it starts — not where it ends. FactWise automates every workflow — from quotes and vendors to orders, approvals, and payments — so your team spends less time chasing and more time closing.": "采购是业务流程的起点，而不是终点。FactWise 自动化从报价、供应商到订单、审批和付款的每个工作流，让团队少花时间追进度，多花时间完成决策。",
