    "money, time, and control.": "资金、时间和控制力。",
    "Hidden overspend, manual bottlenecks, and zero visibility — three problems quietly draining your business every day.": "隐藏的超支、手工瓶颈和缺乏可视性，这三个问题每天都在悄悄消耗业务。",
