    "Without historical price intelligence, you miss savings on every order. FactWise tracks all quotes, purchase orders, and contracts to ensure you always pay the best price.": "没有历史价格智能，每一笔订单都可能错失节省机会。FactWise 跟踪所有报价、采购订单和合同，帮助您始终支付最佳价格。",
    "Drowning in manual work.": "被手工工作淹没。",
    "Emails, follow-ups, and spreadsheets waste valuable hours. FactWise automates your entire cycle — from onboarding and customer quotes to requisitions, approvals, and payments.": "邮件、跟进和电子表格会浪费大量时间。FactWise 自动化整个周期，从入驻、客户报价到请购、审批和付款。",
