    "Configure approval chains, custom fields, cost formulas, and event templates independently without writing code or waiting on IT. FactWise bends to how you run your business, giving your team full control of every workflow from day one.": "无需写代码或等待 IT，即可独立配置审批链、自定义字段、成本公式和事件模板。FactWise 适应您的业务运作方式，让团队从第一天起掌控每个工作流。",
    "Your Business. Your Rules. No IT Required.": "您的业务，您的规则，无需 IT。",
    "Scale Effortlessly": "轻松扩展",
    "Manage direct materials, indirect procurement, and complex BOMs at any volume without multiplying the workload. FactWise automates routine tasks, combined requisitions, and bid analysis so your team focuses on decisions, not data entry.": "无论规模大小，都可管理直接物料、间接采购和复杂 BOM，而不会成倍增加工作量。FactWise 自动化日常任务、合并请购和投标分析，让团队专注决策而非录入数据。",
    "AI Powered Analytics": "AI 驱动分析",
    "Make informed awards and protect your margins with real-time bid intelligence, historical pricing, and vendor performance metrics. FactWise delivers instant spend visibility and live KPIs exactly when and where you need them.": "借助实时投标智能、历史价格和供应商绩效指标，做出更明智的定标决策并保护利润率。FactWise 在需要时提供即时支出可视化和实时 KPI。",
    "Collaborate Seamlessly": "无缝协作",
